Parametric window sealer: licensing

This repository is under two licences, file by file, in the REUSE layout
(https://reuse.software):

- Code, including the code that defines the pieces' shapes, and the scripts,
  hooks, tests, CI and tool configuration: Mozilla Public License 2.0
  (MPL-2.0), in LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt.
- The documentation: CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Strongly
  Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S-2.0), in LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt.

Which licence covers which file is recorded in REUSE.toml.

The STL and other files this tool generates, and anything you print from
them, are yours to use, change, share or sell for any purpose, with no
conditions from this project.
